    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "The Re-scheduled Performance of Tonye Aganaba! Saturday, May 23rd, 2025 at 7:15pm Rossland Miners Hall Performance Hall Length: 2 x 45-minute sets with a 15-minute intermission in between Concession &amp; Bar preshow, intermission and postshow. Licensed. After having to cancel their performance in Rossland during Blizzard Music Festival 2026, we have some amazing news: Tonye Aganaba is officially coming [&hellip;]"
      },
      {
