        "@value": "The Re-scheduled Performance of Tonye Aganaba! Saturday, May 23rd, 2025 at 7:15pm Rossland Miners Hall Performance Hall Length: 2 x 45-minute sets with a 15-minute intermission in between Concession &amp; Bar preshow, [&hellip;]"
      }
