    "http://schema.org/description": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Join us for a community football watch party fundraiser supporting local arts and culture! Enjoy the big game on a large screen with great sound, pizza, wings, desserts, and a licensed cash bar. This is a family-friendly event. Kids are welcome, with a colouring and activity table available when they need a break from the [&hellip;]"
